      "order": 5,
      "text": "For bye-law 6.0, the following shall be substituted: '6.0 Permissible Deviations During Construction: Dimensional deviations in setbacks, ground coverage, and building height up to the limits specified in revised Table 2B (up to 10 percent for residential plots up to 240 sq.m and up to 5 percent for larger plots without violating FAR or road alignment) may be regularised upon payment of compounding fees prior to Occupancy Certificate.'",
